# Updating constraints

When a design choice changes (protocol, codegen, what Koishi may do):

1. Update `docs/decisions.md` (ADR) and the relevant spec in `docs/`.
2. Update `AGENTS.md` and the matching `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` in the same PR.
3. Do not leave a rule that contradicts a doc.
   Do not paste long chat logs into the repo. Extract MUST / MUST NOT only.
